        "citation": "Hollister et al. 1994, Clin Orthop 298:272-276 (fresh specimens)",
        "finding": "the forearm rotation axis runs from the radial head center to the distal ulna center; the radial head is the proximal terminus \u2014 no positive distal fraction.",
        "id": "S3"
      }
    ]
